  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COASTAL HABITAT ENHANCEMENT FOR WATERFOW</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will enhance the hydrology of 4,318 hectares/10,665.46 acres of coastal wetlands along 2 of the northern coast of the state of Yucatan, near Chicxulub Puerto and Telchac Puerto. It will also evaluate interstitial salinity, productivity and habitat use by resident and migratory birds</narrative>
  </description>
